    Apache License, Version 2.0.

The complete and authoritative record of what changed is this project's git
history. OmniSim is not a redistribution of Webots: it is a substantially
modified derivative work with different physics defaults, a different renderer
path, a different controller runtime, and large bodies of newly authored code
that have no upstream counterpart.

